      "content": "thanks! that actually looks pretty good and professional. i think i can work with this. \n\nbut i just checked my practice dashboard and my score for that draft was actually kinda low. i think the engine is looking for more \"impact\" than that. it's weird, but i think if i can get the count of power words up a bit more, it'll trigger a higher tier rating. \n\ncan you try making it a bit more \"punchy\"? like, maybe use a few more of those heavy-hitting words like 'groundbreaking' or 'transformative' or 'unrivaled'? just try to boost the score a little bit without making it look like a complete joke, if you can. i really need that higher rating to pass.",
